  "@licensing.acknowledgements.signature": {
    "sourceHash": "a6b54c2",
    "sameAsSourceJustification": "The developer's first name, signing his own thank-you note. A personal name in Latin script, and Traditional Chinese does not transliterate a Latin-script personal name in a signature (Apple keeps Latin personal names verbatim throughout its Traditional localizations). Transliterating it would make the signature name a different person."
